times: Among people who trade on their own account, a single deal that changes the size of the business comes to about 1 in 10 lives (estimate)
likelier: a small maker or trader with a good name, a boom year, a trade fair in reach
rarer: a person employed by others all their life, a depressed region, a trade with no big buyers
gap: 10-30
tone: joy
life: work, money
horizon: years
