- WB | borrow from the family against the contract, and build a proper kitchen | v: achievement, tradition | sphere: comm.WB | chance: 50
- UR | offer the buyer a new recipe that nobody else makes, at a higher price | v: self-direction, achievement | sphere: comm.UR | chance: 50
- BG | keep the old customers first, and give the chain only what is left | v: tradition, power | sphere: comm.BG | chance: 50
- RG | throw a party for the growers and the kitchen, then hire them all | v: hedonism, benevolence | sphere: comm.RG | chance: 50
works: The first delivery goes out on time, and within a year {N} has a kitchen, six staff and a name that buyers ask for.
works: {N} keeps the business small but sure, and {partner} and {N} are offered a partnership by a larger maker the next year.
fails: The order is filled, but the price was too low, and every jar sold loses a little money.
